flowchart TD
    subgraph SEL[Selection Shortcut Sheet]
      direction TB
      H([Long-press Command]) --> READ[Read selection ONCE<br/>while source app still frontmost]
      READ --> IN[Inputs: text·file·image·url·<br/>clipboard·frontmost app·window title]
      IN --> MATCH[Match triggers]
      MATCH --> ACT{Action sources}
      ACT --> B1[Built-in selection ext]
      ACT --> B2[User extensions]
      ACT --> B3[App menu actions / adapters]
      ACT --> B4[macOS Shortcuts]
      ACT --> B5[AI actions]
      B1 & B2 & B3 & B4 & B5 --> RUN[Run chosen action]
    end

    subgraph CLIP[Clipboard scope · ambient]
      direction TB
      COPY([Any copy]) --> PILL[Pill slides into corner<br/>independent of dock state]
      PILL --> CARD[Grows to card of recent clips<br/>under pointer · smooth morph]
      CARD --> USE[Pick a clip → paste or feed to action]
    end

    CARD -.clipboard is also an input.-> IN
